{
  "version": 1,
  "meta": {
    "titulo": "La torre mixta: mismo R de tabla, un R₁ por cada dirección — la cadena §5.1.2 → Ec. (1b) → banda §5.12–§5.13 → Ec. (14) (NCh2369:2025)",
    "ficha": "struct_pad/src/content/apuntes/ejemplo-torre-sismica-nch2369.mdx",
    "esperadoFalso": {
      "v_QX_bajo_maximo": "Es el hallazgo del §5 del post: el corte del CBF (474,9 kN) SUPERA el Q0máx de §5.13 (444,4 kN), y por eso la norma permite recortarlo un 6,4 %. El ✗ es la tesis, no un defecto."
    }
  },
  "regions": [
    { "id": "r000", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 32, "src": "LA TORRE MIXTA — un R₁ por cada dirección (NCh2369:2025)" },
    { "id": "r001", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 80, "src": "CBF en X, marco de momento en Y. Los T*, cortes y masas vienen del análisis validado en dos motores (case09 rukan ↔ SAP2000, <0,01 %): acá son DATOS. La cadena normativa de encima es la que esta planilla rehace." },
    { "id": "r002", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 128, "src": "— DATOS · gravedad por nivel (kN) y fracción de sobrecarga §5.1.2 —" },
    { "id": "r003", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 176, "src": "D_1 := 300 kN" },
    { "id": "r004", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 224, "src": "L_1 := 100 kN" },
    { "id": "r005", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 272, "src": "D_2 := 550 kN" },
    { "id": "r006", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 320, "src": "L_2 := 250 kN" },
    { "id": "r007", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 368, "src": "D_3 := 250 kN" },
    { "id": "r008", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 416, "src": "L_3 := 50 kN" },
    { "id": "r009", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 464, "src": "a := 0.25" },
    { "id": "r010", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 512, "src": "— DATOS · sitio y sistema (Tablas 3, 6 y 7; zona 3, suelo D, soldadas) —" },
    { "id": "r011", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 560, "src": "A_r := 0.56" },
    { "id": "r012", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 608, "src": "S := 1.00" },
    { "id": "r013", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 656, "src": "T_1 := 0.41 s" },
    { "id": "r014", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 704, "src": "I := 1.0" },
    { "id": "r015", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 752, "src": "R := 5" },
    { "id": "r016", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 800, "src": "xi := 0.02" },
    { "id": "r017", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 848, "src": "— DATOS · salida del análisis modal espectral (dos motores, <0,01 %) —" },
    { "id": "r018", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 896, "src": "T_X := 0.220185 s" },
    { "id": "r019", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 944, "src": "T_Y := 0.995672 s" },
    { "id": "r020", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 992, "src": "Q_0X := 474.877 kN" },
    { "id": "r021", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 1040, "src": "Q_0Y := 255.910 kN" },
    { "id": "r022", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 1088, "src": "SumU_x := 0.9723" },
    { "id": "r023", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 1136, "src": "SumU_y := 0.99999" },
    { "id": "r024", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 1184, "src": "— 1 · peso sísmico §5.1.2 e irregularidad de masa §5.2.2 —" },
    { "id": "r025", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 1232, "src": "P_1 := D_1 + a*L_1 = " },
    { "id": "r026", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 1280, "src": "P_2 := D_2 + a*L_2 = " },
    { "id": "r027", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 1328, "src": "P_3 := D_3 + a*L_3 = " },
    { "id": "r028", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 1376, "src": "P := P_1 + P_2 + P_3 = kN" },
    { "id": "r029", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 1424, "src": "razonMasa := P_2/P_1 = " },
    { "id": "v_irregular", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 1472, "src": "v_irregular := razonMasa > 1.50 = " },
    { "id": "r031", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 1520, "src": "✓ = irregular de masa → fuera del método estático: análisis modal espectral (§5.2.2)" },
    { "id": "r032", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 1568, "src": "— 2 · la rampa de la Ec. (1b): cada dirección elige su lado —" },
    { "id": "r033", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 1616, "src": "CrT_1 := 0.16*R*T_1 = " },
    { "id": "v_rampaX", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 1664, "src": "v_rampaX := T_X < CrT_1 = " },
    { "id": "v_mesetaY", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 1712, "src": "v_mesetaY := T_Y >= CrT_1 = " },
    { "id": "r036", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 1760, "src": "Rstar_X := 1.5 + (R - 1.5)*T_X/CrT_1 = " },
    { "id": "r037", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 1808, "src": "Rstar_Y := R = " },
    { "id": "r038", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 1856, "src": "Rstar_Y = R porque v_mesetaY: T*_Y ≥ Cr·T1 (Ec. 1b, rama plana). Mismo R de tabla, dos R*." },
    { "id": "r039", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 1904, "src": "— 3 · la banda §5.12–§5.13 (no depende del análisis) —" },
    { "id": "r040", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 1952, "src": "f_xi := (0.05/xi)^0.4 = " },
    { "id": "r041", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2000, "src": "Q_0min := 0.25*I*A_r*S*P = " },
    { "id": "r042", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2048, "src": "Q_0max := 2.75*I*A_r*S/(R + 1)*f_xi*P = " },
    { "id": "v_QX_sobre_minimo", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2096, "src": "v_QX_sobre_minimo := Q_0X >= Q_0min = " },
    { "id": "v_QX_bajo_maximo", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2144, "src": "v_QX_bajo_maximo := Q_0X <= Q_0max = " },
    { "id": "v_QY_sobre_minimo", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2192, "src": "v_QY_sobre_minimo := Q_0Y >= Q_0min = " },
    { "id": "v_QY_bajo_maximo", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2240, "src": "v_QY_bajo_maximo := Q_0Y <= Q_0max = " },
    { "id": "r047", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2288, "src": "factorRecorte := Q_0max/Q_0X = " },
    { "id": "r048", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 2336, "src": "El ✗ de X es el hallazgo: §5.13 permite recortar las fuerzas por 0,936 (−6,4 %). No aplica a desplazamientos." },
    { "id": "r049", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 2384, "src": "— 4 · R₁ efectivo (Ec. 14) y el multiplicador de capacidad —" },
    { "id": "r050", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2432, "src": "R_1X := Rstar_X*min(Q_0X/Q_0min, 1) = " },
    { "id": "r051", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2480, "src": "R_1Y := Rstar_Y*min(Q_0Y/Q_0min, 1) = " },
    { "id": "r052", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2528, "src": "cap_X := 0.7*R_1X = " },
    { "id": "r053", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2576, "src": "cap_Y := 0.7*R_1Y = " },
    { "id": "r054", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2624, "src": "razonCap := cap_Y/cap_X = " },
    { "id": "r055", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 2672, "src": "0,7R₁ = 2,695 en X y 3,500 en Y: un 30 % de diferencia que ninguna tabla muestra — la produce el período." },
    { "id": "r056", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 2720, "src": "— 5 · masa modal acumulada §5.6.2 —" },
    { "id": "v_masaX", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2768, "src": "v_masaX := SumU_x >= 0.90 = " },
    { "id": "v_masaY", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2816, "src": "v_masaY := SumU_y >= 0.90 = " }
  ]
}
